# Git Commit Messages Must Be in English

All git commit messages **must** be written in English, including:

- Commit title (subject line)
- Commit body (description)
- Any bullet points or changelog entries

Use conventional commit format:

```
feat: add cable protocol auto-retry strategy
fix: resolve VSP error callback not propagating to upper layer
refactor: replace blocking detection with try-order approach
docs: update integration guide
chore: bump SDK version to 1.0.6
```

Even if the user communicates in Chinese or another language, always write the commit message in English.
